      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Having a picnic is one of the great joys of summer. Before you start "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "hunting",
            "ref": "v-hunt"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " for a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "shady",
            "ref": "v-shady"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " place to eat your sandwiches, there are some things you should think about."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h1",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Packing your foods"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Before you set off, check if your food box is shut "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "tight",
            "ref": "v-tight"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". If it’s a hot summer’s day, then a cool box will come in super handy for keeping your picnic foods. Don’t forget to pack cups or bottles for drinks."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h2",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Food safety"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "You should keep things like meat pies, fish and dairy dishes in cold boxes. You’d better keep your foods on ice for as long as possible before you eat them. Finally, carry some hand "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "sanitizer",
            "zh": "洗手液"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Make sure that everyone’s hands are clean before they touch the foods."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "h3",
        "type": "heading",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "Delicious snacks"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "After you have prepared the main dishes, it’s time to pack some snacks. Chips, chocolate bars and cookies are "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "considered",
            "ref": "v-consider"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " great picnic snacks. They are very delicious, of course, but be careful not to eat too many of them."
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
